ed ingredients</span></div><div class="card hero"><div class="row"><div><h4>Items needing attention</h4><p>Use, move or adjust tomorrow's prep.</p></div><span class="pill amber">2 items</span></div><table class="table" style="margin-top:12px"><thead><tr><th>Ingredient</th><th>Stock</th><th>Expected use</th><th>Expiry</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Tomato sauce</td><td>18 kg</td><td>12 kg</td><td><span class="pill amber">Tomorrow</span></td><td><button class="action" onclick="showToast('Tomato sauce moved to priority use')">Prioritize</button></td></tr><tr><td>Leafy greens</td><td>22 kg</td><td>18 kg</td><td><span class="pill green">3 days</span></td><td><button class="action" onclick="showToast('Inventory reviewed')">Review</button></td></tr><tr><td>Chicken</td><td>46 kg</td><td>39 kg</td><td><span class="pill green">4 days</span></td><td><button class="action" onclick="showToast('Inventory reviewed')">Review</button></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="section-title"><h3>Procurement signals</h3><span>Next 3 days</span></div><div class="cards3"><div class="card metric"><div class="label">Buy more</div><div class="value" style="font-size:22px">2</div><div class="sub">Ingredients</div></div><div class="card metric"><div class="label">Use first</div><div class="value warning" style="font-size:22px">1</div><div class="sub">Ingredient</div></div><div class="card metric"><div class="label">Stable</div><div class="value positive" style="font-size:22px">14</div><div class="sub">Ingredients</div></div></div>`,
simulator:()=>`<div class="section-title"><h3>Before-Serving Simulator</h3><span>Decision support · before service</span></div><div class="card hero"><div class="row"><div><h4>Pasta + greens · 720 expected students</h4><p>Select an intervention and compare its projected impact.</p></div><span class="pill blue" id="simStatus">Scenario ready</span></div><div class="intervention-grid"><button class="intervention active" id="iv-portion" onclick="chooseIntervention('portion')"><b>Portion</b><span>Reduce regular rice portion</span></button><button class="intervention" id="iv-recipe" onclick="chooseIntervention('recipe')"><b>Recipe</b><span>Change pasta sauce recipe</span></button><button class="intervention" id="iv-prep" onclick="chooseIntervention('prep')"><b>Preparation</b><span>Change cooking / seasoning method</span></button><button class="intervention" id="iv-serving" onclick="chooseIntervention('serving')"><b>Serving</b><span>Serve sauce separately</span></button></div><div class="scenario-grid" style="margin-top:14px"><div class="scenario"><div class="label">Current plan</div><div class="big-number">12.0%</div><div class="sub">Projected waste</div><div class="impact"><div class="mini"><b>Acceptance</b><strong>84%</strong></div><div class="mini"><b>Nutrition</b><strong>91</strong></div><div class="mini"><b>Cost / meal</b><strong>35k₫</strong></div><div class="mini"><b>Prep</b><strong>720</strong></div></div></div><div class="scenario recommended"><div class="label positive">Selected option</div><div class="big-number positive" id="simWaste">9.7%</div><div class="sub">Projected waste</div><div class="impact"><div class="mini"><b>Acceptance</b><strong id="simAcc">82%</strong></div><div class="mini"><b>Nutrition</b><strong id="simNut">89</strong></div><div class="mini"><b>Cost / meal</b><strong id="simCost">34k₫</strong></div><div class="mini"><b>Prep</b><strong id="simPrep">680</strong></div></div></div></div><div class="section-title" style="margin-top:18px"><h3>Nutrition guardrail</h3><span>Must pass before approval</span></div><div class="tradeoff" id="guardrails"><div class="guard ok"><b>Protein</b><strong>Pass</strong></div><div class="guard ok"><b>Vegetables</b><strong>Pass</strong></div><div class="guard warn"><b>Balance score</b><strong id="guardScore">89 · Review</strong></div><div class="guard ok"><b>Overall</b><strong id="guardOverall">Review</strong></div></div><div class="section-title" style="margin-top:18px"><h3>FoodLoop recommendation</h3><span>Evidence-backed scenario</span></div><div class="recommend-box"><h4 id="simTitle">Reduce regular portion by 10%</h4><p id="simReason">Based on portion preference signals and recent waste data. The nutrition score must remain above the school's threshold before this option can be approved.</p></div><div class="row" style="margin-top:14px"><span class="small-note">Projected values are model outputs; real results are measured in Experiments.</span><button class="action primary" id="expBtn" onclick="createExperiment()">Create experiment</button></div></div>`,
experiments:()=>`<div class="section-title"><h3>Experiments</h3><span>Small changes, measured outcomes</span></div><div class="cards2"><div class="card hero"><div class="hero-head"><div><h4>EXP-014 · Pasta sauce</h4><p>Recipe trial · Tue</p></div><span class="pill green">Completed</span></div><div class="cards2" style="margin-top:13px"><div class="mini"><b>Waste before</b><strong>14.4%</strong></div><div class="mini"><b>Waste after</b><strong class="positive">8.6%</strong></div><div class="mini"><b>Acceptance before</b><strong>71%</strong></div><div class="mini"><b>Acceptance after</b><strong class="positive">87%</strong></div></div><div class="insight" style="margin-top:13px"><strong>Learning signal</strong><span>New sauce improved acceptance while lowering returned food.</span></div><button class="action primary" style="margin-top:12px" onclick="addResults()">Add results to FoodLoop</button></div><div class="card hero"><div class="hero-head"><div><h4>EXP-015 · Greens portion</h4><p>Serving-size trial · 2 services</p></div><span class="pill amber">Running</span></div><div class="progress" style="margin:16px 0 6px"><i style="width:55%"></i></div><div class="row"><span class="sub">1 of 2 services recorded</span><button class="action" onclick="showToast('Experiment record opened')">Open</button></div><div class="section-title" style="margin-top:18px"><h3>Experiment log</h3><span>Latest</span></div><table class="table"><tbody><tr><td>Baseline captured</td><td>✓</td></tr><tr><td>Service 1</td><td>Recorded</td></tr><tr><td>Service 2</td><td>Pending</td></tr></tbody></table>`,